A '''yacht''' was a type of [[Boat|aquatic vessel]]. The ''[[Undisputed Victor]]'' was a yacht which sailed over the [[Sea of Cantonica]] of the [[planet]] [[Cantonica]].<ref name="Hear Nothing, See Nothing, Say Nothing">{{StoryCite|story=Hear Nothing, See Nothing, Say Nothing|book=Canto Bight (novella collection)}}</ref>

